  "what": "Stock module profiles -- what a factory Naya module ships with.",
  "source": "Recovered from the reference machine's NayaFlow user-data, cross-checked against docs/reference/naya-default-module-bindings.json (the installer's own default map). The Track BUTTON assignments are absent from the installer file -- it only carries horizontal/vertical -- and were confirmed independently by the device owner, matching the DB exactly.",
